  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the APEC Secretariat Policy Support Unit (PSU)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support engagement with the Asia Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) forum through capacity bulding and training at the APEC Secretariat Policy Support Unit (PSU). The APEC PSU improves the quality of APECs work program by providing APEC committees with professional and tailor-made research, analysis, policy support, and evidence-based policy suggestions, which particularly benefit developing countries and allow them to play a larger institutional role in APEC committees.</narrative>
  </description>
